            "title": "Zen Bound 2 Updated",
            "date": "2010-12-15 17:03:00",
            "url": "http://store.steampowered.com/news/4791/",
            "notes": " \nFIXES:<br><br>- Fixed saving game state when Steam Cloud is disabled<br>- Clockwise/counterclockwise rotation speed limited (reduces rope interpenetration)<br>- Audio issues addressed<br>- Memory leaks fixed<br>- The game now properly saves the game when the user exits by pressing the esc-key<br>- New game configuration file for troubleshooting purposes<br><br><a href=\"http://store.steampowered.com/app/61600/\"><img src=\"http://storefront.steampowered.com/v/gfx/apps/61600/capsule_231x87.jpg\" style=\" float: left; margin-right: 12px; height: 87px; width: 231px;\"></a>\t\t\t\t"
        },
        {
